<title>USA: Rock Hill SD 3, S.C., $2.5 mln won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Rock Hill SD 3, S.C., $2.5 mln won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union  said it won $2.500 million of Rock Hill School District No. 3, S.C., unlimited tax general obligation bonds, series 1997B, with a true interest cost of 4.344 percent.</p>
</text>
